cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use Slidecast in your work, please cite it."
title: Slidecast
abstract: >-
  Turns a PowerPoint deck into a narrated AV1/HEVC video, fully offline: each slide's speaker notes are read
  aloud in a voice cloned locally from a short sample (Chatterbox-Turbo), with subtitles.
type: software
version: 1.0.0
date-released: 2026-10-14
license: MIT
repository-code: https://github.com/edlmar/Slidecast
